<title>USA: IP Timberlands Ltd Q1 EPS $1.26 vs $5.66.</title>
<headline>IP Timberlands Ltd Q1 EPS $1.26 vs $5.66.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			 1996</p>
<p>	  3  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.26		    $5.66</p>
<p> Net			 60,000		  686,000</p>
<p> Revs			72,000		   81,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Share earnings are earnings per class A depositary unit for the quarter ended March 31.</p>
<p>Earnings in 1996 Q1 included a gain of $638 million, or $4.37 per unit, on the sale of a subsidiary.</p>
<p>Earnings in 1997 Q1 include a gain of $15 million from the sale of acreage in Arkansas and Texas.</p>
